// Appeal contract for moderation-service (RP7-RP12). The affected user appeals one or
// more final decisions: a closed report's outcome, an account warning, a
// review removal, or a decision to keep a review they reported. Suspended users
// may appeal. Administrators review the appeal, may ask another affected
// participant to respond, and close it with an upheld or overturned outcome for
